		(property "Description" "WeAct Studio STM32G474CEU6 Core Board (square, 36x28 mm). Pin P1.n / P2.n = header P1/P2 pin n. VCC is the LDO input (3.3-20 V); USB VBUS feeds VCC through a Schottky diode. 3V3 is the LDO output. PA6/PA7/PB0/PB1/PB10/PB11 drive the on-board QSPI flash."
